.SH NAME
gmb - GlassMarble – Intelligent Architecture Knowledge Graph Platform


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgmb [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
GlassMarble (gmb) builds, queries, governs, and visualizes a self-evolving
Architecture Knowledge Graph (AKG) from your source code repositories.

.PP
Analyze codebases with sub-second incremental parsing, track architectural drift,
render 31+ diagram types (Mermaid, PlantUML, Graphviz), and reason over system design
with local or cloud AI models.

.PP
GitHub: https://github.com/Syamchand123/GlassMarble
Documentation: https://github.com/Syamchand123/GlassMarble#readme


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--color\fP="auto"
	Color output mode: auto|always|never

.PP
\fB-c\fP, \fB--config\fP=""
	Config file path (default is $HOME/.glassmarble.yaml)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging

.PP
\fB--dir\fP=""
	Target repository directory for analysis and queries

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for gmb

.PP
\fB--max-json-mb\fP=0
	Refuse to load or commit an AKG state file (akg.json) larger than this many MiB (0 = unlimited)

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-error output

.PP
\fB-v\fP, \fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Verbose output logging


